.61\">28:61</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ספר התורה הזה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.20\">29:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 30:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.30.10\">30:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.26\">31:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:8\" href=\"/Joshua.1.8\">Jos 1:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ספר התורה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:34\" href=\"/Joshua.8.34\">8:34</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.8\">2 K 22:8</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.15\">2 Ch 34:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דברי התורה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:34\" href=\"/Joshua.8.34\">Jos 8:34</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.24\">2 K 23:24</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">התורה אשׁר צוך משׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:7\" href=\"/Joshua.1.7\">Jos 1:7</a>, similarly <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:5\" href=\"/Joshua.22.5\">22:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.13\">2 K 17:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.34\">34</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.8\">21:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹרַת משׁה (ספר)</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:31\" href=\"/Joshua.8.31\">Jos 8:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:32\" href=\"/Joshua.8.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:6\" href=\"/Joshua.23.6\">23:6</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.3\">1 K 2:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.6\">2 K 14:6</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">הַתּ׳ בספר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.4\">2 Ch 25:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.25\">2 K 23:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי סֵפֶר הַתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.11\">2 K 22:11</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">דברי הַתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.19\">2 Ch 34:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹרַת יהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.31\">2 K 10:31</a>. It is probable that <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> in <a data-ref=\"Psalms 1:2\" href=\"/Psalms.1.2\">ψ 1:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:12\" href=\"/Psalms.94.12\">94:12</a> and some other parts of Chr., e.g. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.12\">1 Ch 22:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.16\">2 Ch 6:16</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.25\">1 K 8:25</a> without <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span>), refers to Deuteronomic code. (3) other passages of Chr. may refer to code of D, but most of them certainly refer to <em>the law of the Priests’ code</em>. The same is true of Mal Dn and late ψψ. The phrases are: <span dir=\"rtl\">(ספר) תורת משׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.18\">2 Ch 23:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.16\">30:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:2\" href=\"/Ezra.3.2\">Ezr 3:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:6\" href=\"/Ezra.7.6\">7:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.1\">Ne 8:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:22\" href=\"/Malachi.3.22\">Mal 3:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:11\" href=\"/Daniel.9.11\">Dn 9:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:13\" href=\"/Daniel.9.13\">13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תורת יהוה (ספר)</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:10\" href=\"/Ezra.7.10\">Ezr 7:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.3\">Ne 9:3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.40\">1 Ch 16:40</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 12:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.12.1\">2 Ch 12:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.9\">17:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.3\">31:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.14\">34:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:26\" href=\"/II_C